  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_3a305eddf26e4c62a2f38d6f58b17767",
      "statement": "The Nuxt HTTP plugin provides the shared `$api` transport instance; API clients lazily obtain it from `useNuxtApp()`, define endpoint-specific paths and payloads, and deliberately leave response transformation to downstream layers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/infrastructure/http/clients/AuthApiClient.ts#L15-L27",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9d7af58da46efe77eda1e4f5c32b81f73a0fd31c8af5c5081bceb8687ac5a0ac:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/infrastructure/http/clients/CartApiClient.ts#L3-L15",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2108308b062e061b8bcc25eccdb580663eb12e4f7d636a62047590d980b19c04:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/infrastructure/http/clients/index.ts#L3-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a8e5ea69eae143a0fcf036e122a579fec9f90660fd458bffec66578defc84825:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/plugins/http.ts#L250-L266",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:548240f746034161a5f1d9bf9aa755e3203480e37f9bd944965f8876efd6453d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cfa0d11aead74056848b3da6ce6cbcf9",
      "statement": "Before dispatch, the HTTP plugin conditionally adds a Bearer token, `company_id`, locale-derived `country_code`, and a B2C-only `distributor_id`; `skipAuth`, `skipCompanyId`, `skipCountryCode`, and `skipDistributorId` control those injections, while a real distributor ID is preserved and an unresolved default store does not send `0`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/plugins/http.ts#L21-L101",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:59c6df7ef35fc16fd199aca7e6de1f6a5f13386069825260b9db51a3bfdb6194:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/plugins/http.ts#L266-L305",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:31add0205c2095e6ccaf15a76384cd5bf9db52c6721a7bf60e1a7e9153331fda:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/types/http.ts#L4-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:05415fbaa3ac694d8e4d3c30cb590a87c5344b96626f5ff616ea7e672bd10e5a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d2a89655317147e384f9084206d3ed53",
      "statement": "The plugin routes GET parameters through `query`, defaults other structured requests to `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`, supports `useJson: true` for JSON bodies, leaves `FormData` and `Blob` bodies structurally untouched, and does not overwrite a caller-provided `Content-Type`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/plugins/http.ts#L174-L209",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9c464be34806d834ccf1d610a856d6bbbccc0200c91e1a571286525108e9ec16:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/plugins/http.ts#L278-L308",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b144df21025813b20a247fb44e039e82b69befe980a5b28bd8266c266e9cddb6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/utils/formUrlencoded.ts#L1-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:86e027a108d00bf4eb3cf8c2a294e4249c1778af547b7eeaf19f007d09a1daa5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5db762d731b74d3589b087d0670dada3",
      "statement": "The form serializer is shallow, so endpoint clients must encode nested or repeated values themselves: `OrderApiClient` JSON-stringifies `recommend_item_id`, while `PaymentApiClient` expands voucher images into indexed `voucher_pic[n]` keys; JSON recommendation matching uses `useJson: true` to preserve arrays.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/infrastructure/http/clients/ItemApiClient.spec.ts#L64-L112",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3b313e96dacca5cf7b1cd32366293a594a9d0ce51c6bc0cd1c6a05c9ba9219a3:"
        },
