        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9471254738014fc2bdab38fa8388143a",
      "statement": "Both an HTTP 401 and a business `status_code` of 401 navigate the client to the localized `/account/login` route, and this plugin boundary does not perform automatic refresh or logout; token refresh is an explicit `AuthApiClient.refreshToken()` and `userStore.refreshAuthToken()` flow, while logout and failed user-info recovery clear session state in the user store.",
