      "id": "claim_24d62f680e6d436eaf8b25e26d0d732f",
      "statement": "Focused API-client tests verify the transport contract at the call boundary: item recommendation requests preserve JSON arrays and omit invalid distributor IDs while retaining real IDs, and offline voucher uploads use indexed form keys.",
